## 2. Display Management

### List Displays
**GET** `/api/optisigns/displays`

Get paginated list of synchronized displays.

**Query Parameters:**
- `page` (integer, default: 1) - Page number
- `limit` (integer, default: 50) - Items per page
- `status` (string) - Filter by status: online, offline, unknown
- `isActive` (boolean) - Filter by active status

**Response:**
```json
{
  "displays": [
    {
      "id": "uuid",
      "tenantId": "tenant123",
      "optisignsDisplayId": "display123",
      "name": "Lobby Display",
      "location": "Main Lobby",
      "status": "online",
      "resolution": {"width": 1920, "height": 1080},
      "orientation": "landscape",
      "isActive": true,
      "lastSeen": "2024-01-01T10:00:00Z",
      "currentContentId": "uuid",
      "currentContent": {
        "id": "uuid",
        "name": "Welcome Message"
      }
    }
  ],
  "totalCount": 10,
  "totalPages": 1,
  "currentPage": 1
}
```

### Sync Displays
**POST** `/api/optisigns/displays/sync`

Synchronize displays from Optisigns API.

**Response:**
```json
{
  "message": "Displays synced successfully",
  "count": 5,
  "displays": [...]
}
```

### Get Single Display
**GET** `/api/optisigns/displays/{id}`

Get detailed information about a specific display.

**Response:**
```json
{
  "id": "uuid",
  "name": "Lobby Display",
  "location": "Main Lobby",
  "status": "online",
  "resolution": {"width": 1920, "height": 1080},
  "orientation": "landscape",
  "currentContent": {
    "id": "uuid",
    "name": "Welcome Message",
    "contentType": "template"
  },
  "executions": [
    {
      "id": "uuid",
      "status": "completed",
      "triggeredBy": "webhook",
      "createdAt": "2024-01-01T10:00:00Z"
    }
  ]
}
```

### Update Display Settings
**PUT** `/api/optisigns/displays/{id}`

Update display settings (local settings only, not Optisigns API).

**Request Body:**
```json
{
  "name": "Updated Display Name",
  "location": "New Location",
  "isActive": true
}
```

