## 3. Content Management

### List Content
**GET** `/api/optisigns/content`

Get paginated list of content templates.

**Query Parameters:**
- `page` (integer, default: 1) - Page number
- `limit` (integer, default: 50) - Items per page
- `contentType` (string) - Filter by type: template, custom, webhook_generated
- `isTemplate` (boolean) - Filter templates only
- `templateCategory` (string) - Filter by template category

**Response:**
```json
{
  "contents": [
    {
      "id": "uuid",
      "name": "Welcome Template",
      "description": "Main welcome message",
      "contentType": "template",
      "isTemplate": true,
      "templateCategory": "welcome",
      "template": {
        "background": {"type": "color", "value": "#ffffff"},
        "elements": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "Welcome {{name}}!",
            "position": {"x": 100, "y": 100},
            "style": {"fontSize": "24px", "color": "#000"}
          }
        ],
        "duration": 30
      },
      "variables": {"name": "Guest"},
      "isActive": true,
      "createdAt": "2024-01-01T10:00:00Z"
    }
  ],
  "totalCount": 15,
  "totalPages": 1,
  "currentPage": 1
}
```

### Get Single Content
**GET** `/api/optisigns/content/{id}`

Get detailed content information.

### Create Content
**POST** `/api/optisigns/content`

Create new content template.

**Request Body:**
```json
{
  "name": "New Template",
  "description": "Description here",
  "contentType": "custom",
  "template": {
    "background": {"type": "color", "value": "#ffffff"},
    "elements": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "content": "Hello {{name}}!",
        "position": {"x": 100, "y": 100},
        "style": {"fontSize": "24px", "color": "#333"}
      },
      {
        "type": "confetti",
        "trigger": "onLoad",
        "duration": 3,
        "variant": "colorful"
      }
    ],
    "animations": [
      {
        "element": 0,
        "type": "fadeIn",
        "duration": 1,
        "delay": 0
      }
    ],
    "duration": 30
  },
  "variables": {
    "name": "Default Name"
  },
  "isTemplate": true,
  "templateCategory": "greeting"
}
```

### Update Content
**PUT** `/api/optisigns/content/{id}`

Update existing content template.

### Delete Content
**DELETE** `/api/optisigns/content/{id}`

Delete content template.

### Preview Content
**POST** `/api/optisigns/content/{id}/preview`

Preview content with variables applied.

**Request Body:**
```json
{
  "variables": {
    "name": "John Doe",
    "company": "Acme Corp",
    "achievement": "Employee of the Month"
  }
}
```

**Response:**
```json
{
  "content": {...},
  "renderedTemplate": {
    "background": {"type": "color", "value": "#ffffff"},
    "elements": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "content": "Hello John Doe!",
        "position": {"x": 100, "y": 100}
      }
    ]
  },
  "variables": {...},
  "metadata": {
    "renderedAt": "2024-01-01T10:00:00Z",
    "variableCount": 3
  }
}
```

### Send Content to Displays
**POST** `/api/optisigns/content/{id}/send`

Manually send content to specific displays.

**Request Body:**
```json
{
  "displayIds": ["uuid1", "uuid2"],
  "duration": 30,
  "variables": {
    "name": "John Doe",
    "company": "Acme Corp"
  }
}
```

**Response:**
```json
{
  "message": "Content sent to displays",
  "executions": [
    {
      "id": "uuid",
      "displayId": "uuid1",
      "status": "sent",
      "sentAt": "2024-01-01T10:00:00Z"
    }
  ]
}
```

