## 6. Execution and Analytics

### Get Execution History
**GET** `/api/optisigns/executions`

Get paginated execution history.

**Query Parameters:**
- `page` (integer) - Page number
- `limit` (integer) - Items per page
- `displayId` (uuid) - Filter by display
- `contentId` (uuid) - Filter by content
- `status` (string) - Filter by status
- `triggeredBy` (string) - Filter by trigger type
- `startDate` (date) - Filter from date
- `endDate` (date) - Filter to date

**Response:**
```json
{
  "executions": [
    {
      "id": "uuid",
      "status": "completed",
      "triggeredBy": "webhook",
      "scheduledFor": null,
      "sentAt": "2024-01-01T10:00:00Z",
      "displayedAt": "2024-01-01T10:00:05Z",
      "completedAt": "2024-01-01T10:00:35Z",
      "duration": 30,
      "plannedDuration": 30,
      "variables": {"name": "John Doe"},
      "content": {
        "id": "uuid",
        "name": "Welcome Template",
        "contentType": "template"
      },
      "display": {
        "id": "uuid", 
        "name": "Lobby Display",
        "location": "Main Lobby"
      },
      "webhookRule": {
        "id": "uuid",
        "name": "New Lead Welcome"
      }
    }
  ],
  "totalCount": 100,
  "totalPages": 2,
  "currentPage": 1
}
```

