Internal endpoint for processing webhook events (called by webhook system).

**Request Body:**
```json
{
  "webhookData": {
    "event_type": "lead_created",
    "lead": {
      "name": "John Doe",
      "company": "Acme Corp",
      "status": "new"
    }
  },
  "webhookEndpointId": "uuid",
  "webhookEventId": "uuid"
}
```

**Response:**
```json
{
  "message": "Processed 2 matching Optisigns rules",
  "matchedRules": 2,
  "executions": 4,
  "executionIds": ["uuid1", "uuid2", "uuid3", "uuid4"]
}
```

